        <mxCell id="accept_rule" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=12" value="统一验收规则&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• `pytest backend/tests/test_data_service.py backend/tests/test_data_service_api.py -q`&lt;br&gt;• 真实知识库：`row/deepseek_split`&lt;br&gt;• 每次较大进展后同步 `CURRENT-STATUS.md`、`current-vs-target-gap.md`、`roadmap`、`drawio`" vertex="1">
